      "cooked": "<p>Hi</p>\n<p>I have created a SUbscription Plan together with a Subscription. My configuration is as per attached screenshots. I do not see any automatically created invoices?</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/f/c/fc8200ffed452898982f6ec861239db74be725ae.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/fc8200ffed452898982f6ec861239db74be725ae\" title=\"Sub-Plan\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/c/fc8200ffed452898982f6ec861239db74be725ae_2_689x378.png\" alt=\"Sub-Plan\" data-base62-sha1=\"A1MQZdwQMAcHovTgpRMEHl1PSCa\" width=\"689\" height=\"378\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/c/fc8200ffed452898982f6ec861239db74be725ae_2_689x378.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/c/fc8200ffed452898982f6ec861239db74be725ae_2_1033x567.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/f/c/fc8200ffed452898982f6ec861239db74be725ae.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"1B1B1B\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Sub-Plan</span><span class=\"informations\">1292×708 32.2 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div><br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/0/e/0e2d7c8fe01b6fe6e96065113849e36849fc89d5.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/0e2d7c8fe01b6fe6e96065113849e36849fc89d5\" title=\"Sub\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/0/e/0e2d7c8fe01b6fe6e96065113849e36849fc89d5_2_690x357.png\" alt=\"Sub\" data-base62-sha1=\"21q8CKINZkeS2QT9oj3xEFu1Ic5\" width=\"690\" height=\"357\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/0/e/0e2d7c8fe01b6fe6e96065113849e36849fc89d5_2_690x357.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/0/e/0e2d7c8fe01b6fe6e96065113849e36849fc89d5_2_1035x535.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/0/e/0e2d7c8fe01b6fe6e96065113849e36849fc89d5_2_1380x714.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"1B1B1B\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Sub</span><span class=\"informations\">1920×995 83.9 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>Would appreciate if someone can pointme to my error ?</p>",
