      "id": 478255,
      "username": "ravibharathi656",
      "name": "RAVIBHARATHI P C",
      "created_at": "2025-08-20T04:17:53.644Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I noticed that the generated invoice is currently unpaid. In the subscription module, there is a validation rule that prevents the creation of a new invoice if there are any outstanding invoices.</p>\n<p>However, if you still need to generate a new invoice despite having outstanding invoices, you can enable the <strong>Generate Invoice Past Due Date</strong> option. This allows the system to create a new invoice even when previous invoices remain unpaid.</p>",
